{"name":"WheelRest – Bicycle Parking UK","dev":"Vadims Savjolovs","keys":["ios:6752814682"],"ios":{"id":"6752814682","url":"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/wheelrest-bicycle-parking-uk/id6752814682?uo=4","rating":4.91667,"ratings":12,"price":"Free","genre":"Travel","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/fd/11/45/fd114527-797a-44d3-776c-c591de8c691b/IMG_8543.PNG/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/0d/f0/ef/0df0ef3b-d8a9-e4be-bb7e-386bb744af18/IMG_8545.PNG/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/ca/b7/2f/cab72f8f-cfcb-1489-ec1e-7cd7c1069856/IMG_143D5742E168-1.jpeg/320x480bb.jpg"],"desc":"WheelRest helps cyclists quickly find bike parking and cycle parking spots anywhere in the UK and Ireland. Whether you're commuting in London, exploring cities like Manchester, Bristol, Edinburgh, or Dublin, or planning a long ride, WheelRest shows you thousands of public bike parking locations right on the map.\n\n- The largest collection of UK and Ireland cycle parking\n- Easy-to-use bike parking map with smooth browsing\n- Navigate directly with Apple Maps or Google Maps\n- Fast, offline-friendly performance for cyclists on the move\n- Free to use — no ads, no accounts, no tracking\n\nPerfect for everyday bike commuters, city cyclists, and long-distance riders. Find your next secure cycle parking spot in seconds.","released":"2025-09-29","updated":"2026-09-20","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/85/1f/d3/851fd308-4529-7dd9-45e0-fab01a6347dc/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007ephone-0-1-85-220.jpeg/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/85/1f/d3/851fd308-4529-7dd9-45e0-fab01a6347dc/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007ephone-0-1-85-220.jpeg/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Travel & Maps","rating":4.92,"ratings":12,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":2,"hn_comments":1,"submissions":1,"self_n":0,"hn_score":4.58,"first":1760